# ─── What IS tracked (do NOT add these above) ─────────────────────────────────
# ✅ src/                   — all source code
# ✅ tests/                 — test suite
# ✅ configs/               — lab.yaml, grading.yaml
# ✅ data/sample/           — sample scenarios
# ✅ reports/lab_report.md  — final report
# ✅ outputs/metrics.json   — graded metrics output
# ✅ outputs/graph_diagram.md — mermaid bonus
# ✅ scripts/               — helper scripts (generate_diagram, time_travel)
AGENT_PLAN.md          — implementation plan
AGENT_PLAN/            — detailed phase specs
# ui/                    — frontend chatbot UI
# ✅ pyproject.toml, Makefile, README.md, Dockerfile — project config
